# V COIN – TON

## Project Overview

V COIN is an independent digital asset and blockchain ecosystem being developed on The Open Network (TON).

## Core Objectives

- Native TON blockchain integration
- Secure token architecture
- Telegram-based user ecosystem
- Mining and level progression system
- User wallet integration
- Transparent accounting and reward distribution
- Global digital payments

## Development Principles

- Independent TON implementation
- Security-first architecture
- Transparent economic rules
- Modular and scalable development
- No changes to the existing BNB Smart Chain project

## Project Status

Initial development phase.
Testnet deployment only after code review and testing.
